# Efficient Token Use (Quality Preserved)

Save tokens by focusing work — never by skipping verification or security.

## Do

- Read only files needed for the task; use graphify queries before wide searches.
- Prefer small, targeted diffs; match existing patterns.
- Batch related tool calls; avoid re-reading files you already have.
- Summarize outcomes briefly; put detail in code/comments only when needed.

## Do not

- Skip security or certainty checks to “save a turn.”
- Dump large unrelated files into context.
- Rewrite working modules for style-only churn.
- Generate docs the user did not ask for (except required project files).
